  "historyNote": "#7424, eff 1-12-01; ss by #9353, INTERIM, eff 1-12-09, EXPIRED: 7-11-09 New. #9515, eff 7-18-09 (formerly Puc 908.11); ss by #9998, eff 9-20-11 (from Puc 908.11); ss by #13080, eff 9-14-20",
